#: ../../source/docs/building-for-beaglebone-black-on-linux.rst:18
#: f682ebf3391646d7b5d1bd2872f18c05
msgid ""
"You will need a microSD card of 4GB or greater and a 5VDC power supply of 1A"
" or higher. You can also use a powered USB hub. It is highly recommended "
"that you not use the USB port on a laptop, which has current limitations."
msgstr ""
"您需要一张 4GB 或更大的 microSD 卡以及 1A 或更高的 5VDC 电源。也可以使用带电源的 USB 集线器。强烈建议不要使用笔记本电脑的 "
"USB 端口，因为其电流限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-beaglebone-black-on-linux.rst:23
#: 019a303d9ddb47cf926cd7edf47a5a42
msgid ""
"Go to the BeagleBoard website and get the `latest image "
"<http://beagleboard.org/latest-images>`__. You may find multiple images on "
"the page. For ArduPilot on BeagleBone Black you have to download the "
"**Debian (BeagleBone Black - 2GB eMMC)** image. You can find it under "
"**BeagleBone Black (eMMC flasher)** header."
msgstr ""
"前往 BeagleBoard 网站获取 `最新镜像 <http://beagleboard.org/latest-"
"images>`__。页面上可能有多个镜像。对于 BeagleBone Black 上的 ArduPilot，您需要下载 **Debian "
"(BeagleBone Black - 2GB eMMC)** 镜像，可在 **BeagleBone Black (eMMC flasher)** "
"标题下找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-beaglebone-black-on-linux.rst:28
#: eb7f527b54774618b2dafd493ad730c5
msgid ""
"For example, the current image is `BBB-eMMC-flasher-"
"debian-7.5-2014-05-14-2gb <http://debian.beagleboard.org/images/BBB-eMMC-"
"flasher-debian-7.5-2014-05-14-2gb.img.xz>`__. The date (in this case "
"2014-05-14) and the version number (in this case 7.5) may change. Make sure "
"you download the latest image."
msgstr ""
"例如，当前镜像为 `BBB-eMMC-flasher-debian-7.5-2014-05-14-2gb "
"<http://debian.beagleboard.org/images/BBB-eMMC-flasher-"
"debian-7.5-2014-05-14-2gb.img.xz>`__。日期（本例为 2014-05-14）和版本号（本例为 "
"7.5）可能会变化。请确保下载最新镜像。"

