msgid ""
"The bootloader used on the BeagleBone black is `u-boot "
"<http://www.denx.de/wiki/U-Boot>`__. u-boot has a special image format "
"called uImage. It includes parameters such as descriptions, the "
"machine/architecture type, compression type, load address, checksums etc. To"
" make these images, you need to have a mkimage tool that comes part of the "
"u-Boot distribution. Download u-boot, make and install the u-boot tools:"
msgstr ""
"BeagleBone Black 上使用的引导程序是 `u-boot "
"<http://www.denx.de/wiki/U-Boot>`__。u-boot 有一种叫做 uImage "
"的特殊镜像格式，包含描述、机器/架构类型、压缩类型、加载地址、校验和等参数。要制作这些镜像，您需要 u-Boot 发行版中附带的 mkimage "
"工具。下载 u-boot，制作并安装 u-boot 工具："

